# Line endings are pinned per file type so a checkout matches what the linters write, whatever
# the machine's core.autocrlf: bash breaks on a CRLF shebang/heredoc, lint-ps1.ps1 writes .ps1
# as CRLF (PowerShell 5.1), and cmd.exe needs CRLF for reliable labels and goto.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
